-036577be-7fff-3c66-f9ed-d6f8b7de29c2">BST Hanoia FW26: N&eacute;t t&#7881; m&#7881; trong s&#417;n m&agrave;i</strong></strong></span></p></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="BW26OOI"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="I7KGJ9J"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="ENMP2H6"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="OL8BC9D"><p id="AB5SNAQ" dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;">S&#417;n m&agrave;i trong BST FW26 l&agrave; c&acirc;u chuy&#7879;n v&#7873; ti&#7875;u ti&#7871;t, n&#417;i k&#7929; ngh&#7879; th&#7911; c&ocirc;ng th&#259;ng hoa qua nh&#7919;ng h&#7885;a ti&#7871;t si&ecirc;u nh&#7887; v&agrave; ph&#7913;c t&#7841;p. S&#7921; t&#7881; m&#7881; &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7849;y t&#7899;i m&#7913;c cao nh&#7845;t, &#273;&ograve;i h&#7887;i t&iacute;nh ki&ecirc;n nh&#7851;n c&ugrave;ng &#273;&ocirc;i tay t&agrave;i hoa c&#7911;a ng&#432;&#7901;i ngh&#7879; nh&acirc;n trong t&#7915;ng thao t&aacute;c. M&#7895;i thi&#7871;t k&#7871; v&igrave; th&#7871; l&agrave; m&#7897;t cu&#7897;c th&#7875; nghi&#7879;m &#273;&#7847;y bi&#7871;n h&oacute;a gi&#7919;a h&#7885;a ti&#7871;t v&agrave; ch&#7845;t li&#7879;u, g&oacute;p th&ecirc;m ng&ocirc;n ng&#7919; bi&#7875;u &#273;&#7841;t m&#7899;i cho th&#7871; gi&#7899;i th&#7911; c&ocirc;ng Hanoia.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="L0Q6EGC"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="E2EB8DE"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="AOVFCWS"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/1_38.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="XT2DIOF"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/1_38.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="E23KAHN"></figure></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="UU7YAIQ"><div data-content-type="divider" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><hr data-element="line" data-pb-style="BJIGLY1"></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="A1DWWB9"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p id="V0604YO" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-e32e99a4-7fff-77de-5120-a08fc1d150f7">Botanica</strong></span></p></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="H3RFM9P"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="SYSRKS1"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="X1LXJRS"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="TEX6P7Y"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">Botanica m&#7903; ra khung c&#7843;nh huy&#7873;n b&iacute; c&#7911;a m&#7897;t khu r&#7915;ng nhi&#7879;t &#273;&#7899;i v&agrave;o &#273;&ecirc;m s&acirc;u, n&#417;i b&oacute;ng t&#7889;i bao ph&#7911; l&ecirc;n v&#7841;n v&#7853;t.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="S8G1402"></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="OI5UM8M"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="TC84NMF"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="FIAMUDS"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/2_30.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="FQDUNF4"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/2_30.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="E7KBTSC"></figure></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="NQVDBF5"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="K0GKURS"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/3_32.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="L966IKG"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/3_32.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="N3WTC6W"></figure></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="KAKSOIV"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="R0ET28L"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="KD5UN8O"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="UHN69M3"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>K&#7929; thu&#7853;t kh&#7855;c tr&ecirc;n Botanica &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ho&agrave;n thi&#7879;n &#7903; m&#7913;c cao nh&#7845;t</em></p></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">Tr&ecirc;n n&#7873;n s&#417;n m&agrave;i &#273;en b&oacute;ng, hi&#7879;n l&ecirc;n l&aacute;t c&#7855;t thi&ecirc;n nhi&ecirc;n tr&ugrave; ph&uacute; v&#7899;i c&#7887; c&acirc;y &#273;an xen, &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n t&#7915; nh&#7919;ng n&eacute;t kh&#7855;c si&ecirc;u m&#7843;nh ph&#7911; nh&#361; b&#7841;c, nh&#361; v&agrave;ng. &#272;&#7875; x&#7917; l&yacute; m&#7853;t &#273;&#7897; h&#7885;a ti&#7871;t d&agrave;y &#273;&#7863;c, c&aacute;c ngh&#7879; nh&acirc;n &#273;&atilde; t&#7881; m&#7881; chia t&aacute;ch v&agrave; th&#7921;c hi&#7879;n kh&#7855;c theo tr&igrave;nh t&#7921;, gi&uacute;p m&#7895;i chi ti&#7871;t &#273;&#7873;u c&oacute; kho&#7843;ng kh&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7875; t&#7887;a s&aacute;ng m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng l&#7845;n &aacute;t l&#7851;n nhau. S&#7921; t&#432;&#417;ng ph&#7843;n gi&#7919;a chi ti&#7871;t s&aacute;ng v&agrave; n&#7873;n t&#7889;i t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n m&#7897;t hi&#7879;u &#7913;ng th&#7883; gi&aacute;c m&#7841;nh m&#7869;, t&#7921;a nh&#432; khu r&#7915;ng &#273;ang &#273;&#432;&#7907;c soi r&#7885;i d&#432;&#7899;i &aacute;nh tr&#259;ng.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="true" data-show-dots="false" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main" data-pb-style="E75P0SS">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
