</div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="XUBNS1F"><div data-content-type="divider" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><hr data-element="line" data-pb-style="UHD9AAP"></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p id="ALB45FO" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-bc02961f-7fff-0a0c-1fef-a5d8983dd63e">Cosmos</strong></span></p></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="Q4H4L0Y"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="PU30EBS"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="F2A8XKV"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="U2SYF5P"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">S&#417;n m&agrave;i l&agrave; h&agrave;nh tr&igrave;nh kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; v&#7867; &#273;&#7865;p ti&#7873;m &#7849;n, b&#7855;t &#273;&#7847;u t&#7915; vi&#7879;c s&#417;n ch&#7891;ng nhi&#7873;u l&#7899;p, r&#7891;i m&agrave;i d&#7847;n, &#273;&#7875; l&#7897; ra nh&#7919;ng s&#7855;c m&agrave;u k&#7923; di&#7879;u. Ch&#7881; v&#7899;i hai k&#7929; thu&#7853;t c&#417; b&#7843;n &#7845;y, Hanoia &#273;&atilde; t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n m&#7897;t Cosmos mang h&#7885;a ti&#7871;t ch&#7845;m m&agrave;u &#273;&#7897;c &#273;&aacute;o.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="F6C8O9G"></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="K2PC4U0"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="EU4MHFI"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="LVWFF5M"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="KQDJTRV"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/4_23.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="Q6Y2PID"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/4_23.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="UR509CS"></figure><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="NTJV1BB"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>Nh&#7919;ng ch&#7845;m m&agrave;u tr&ecirc;n Cosmos &#273;&#432;&#7907;c b&#7891;i &#273;&#7855;p qua hai k&#7929; thu&#7853;t c&#7889;t l&otilde;i: s&#417;n v&agrave; m&agrave;i</em></p></div></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="KQI3VC0"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="YD6WICV"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="MAIT6V0"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="DC7HC4B"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">S&aacute;u t&ocirc;ng m&agrave;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c s&#7917; d&#7909;ng trong ch&#7871; t&aacute;c, t&#7915;ng l&#7899;p m&agrave;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7845;m t&#7881; m&#7881;, &#273;&#7907;i kh&ocirc; ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n m&#7899;i ch&#7845;m m&agrave;u ti&#7871;p theo. Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh n&agrave;y &#273;&ograve;i h&#7887;i ngh&#7879; nh&acirc;n ki&#7875;m so&aacute;t ch&#7863;t ch&#7869; l&#432;&#7907;ng s&#417;n &#273;&#7875; c&aacute;c m&agrave;u h&ograve;a quy&#7879;n m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng l&#7845;n &aacute;t nhau, &#273;&#7891;ng th&#7901;i l&#7921;a ch&#7885;n c&ocirc;ng c&#7909; ph&ugrave; h&#7907;p cho t&#7915;ng &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng n&eacute;t. Nh&#7901; s&#7921; t&#7881; m&#7881;, Cosmos tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh t&aacute;c ph&#7849;m &#273;&#7897;c b&#7843;n, &#273;&#432;&#7907;c &#273;&#7883;nh h&igrave;nh qua t&#7915;ng l&#7899;p s&#417;n ho&agrave;n ch&#7881;nh.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="M74MRKV"></div></div></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="false" data-show-dots="true" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
                                        <li class="product-item">            <div class="product-item-info">
                <div class="product-grid__image-wrapper">
                    <a href="https://hanoia.com/hop-trang-suc-cosmos-af26co04.html" class="product-item-photo">
