a th&#432;&#417;ng hi&#7879;u Hanoia.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="SMISOGE"></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="DYK8IK4"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="NKD22NN"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RWCO6FB"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/8_7.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="LOP4BUF"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/8_7.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="HHP5BNN"></figure><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="VKX4Y2U"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>Khay Red River ti&#7871;p n&#7889;i m&#7897;t d&#7845;u &#7845;n &#273;&#7863;c tr&#432;ng c&#7911;a th&#432;&#417;ng hi&#7879;u</em></p></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="YC16B25"><p style="text-align: center;">Hi&#7879;u &#7913;ng &#273;&#7863;c bi&#7879;t tr&ecirc;n s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m &#273;&#432;&#7907;c t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch ph&#7911; l&ecirc;n nhi&#7873;u l&#7899;p l&aacute; b&#7841;c nhu&#7897;m &#273;&#7891;ng, sau &#273;&oacute; m&agrave;i x&#432;&#7899;c ng&#7851;u nhi&ecirc;n, &#273;&#7875; l&#7897; ra nh&#7919;ng m&#7843;ng m&agrave;u &#273;a s&#7855;c gi&#7919;a gam m&agrave;u &#273;&#7887; l&#7897;ng l&#7851;y xen l&#7851;n s&#7855;c b&#7841;c. Ch&iacute;nh s&#7921; k&#7923; c&ocirc;ng trong t&#7915;ng chi ti&#7871;t mang &#273;&#7871;n m&#7897;t Red River &#273;&#7897;c b&#7843;n v&agrave; &#273;&#7847;y &#7845;n t&#432;&#7907;ng.</p></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="false" data-show-dots="true" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
